/-!
# Erdős Problem 258: separate prime-power proof

This file gives a self-contained formal proof that for any sequence of positive
integers `(aₙ)` with `aₙ → ∞`, the Erdős–Straus series

  `S = ∑_{n ≥ 1} τ(n) / (a₁ a₂ ⋯ aₙ)`

